{
  "running_head": "Section 10B",
  "folio": "139",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 1,
      "bbox": [
        190,
        87,
        307,
        842
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "MYR.",
      "text": "I too would be willing to go through fire. No, by Zeus, I would not do it.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 2,
      "bbox": [
        308,
        87,
        98,
        907
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "LYS.",
      "text": "Oh how totally lascivious is all of our sex! Will no one do what I propose? But, my dear Spartan, would you vote with me? For if so, we might still save the whole business.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 3,
      "bbox": [
        156,
        87,
        218,
        905
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "LAMPITO",
      "text": "By the two gods, it's difficult for us to sleep without sex. But we must bring the war to an end and have peace. I would vote with you.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 4,
      "bbox": [
        221,
        87,
        237,
        759
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "LYS.",
      "text": "O you my dearest friend and the only true woman among them.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 5,
      "bbox": [
        241,
        87,
        255,
        839
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "MYR.",
      "text": "Then if these things seem good to you, they seem a good idea to us too.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
